00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:26.489
Feel sober instantly with a shot!

00:03:26.489 --> 00:03:27.830
Someday, maybe.

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.610
Biochemists at the University of Texas have
discovered that an injection of Fibroblast

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:40.239
Growth Hormone 21, also known as FGF21, cured
mice of alcohol-induced dizziness and impairment.

00:03:40.239 --> 00:03:45.629
They recovered from alcohol six times faster
than mice without it, and when scientists

00:03:45.629 --> 00:03:50.959
gave the shot to mice who had passed out from
alcohol, they woke up twice as fast.

00:03:50.959 --> 00:03:55.659
The hormone doesn’t actually get rid of
the alcohol in the subject’s bloodstream;

00:03:55.659 --> 00:04:00.530
it just stops it from impacting their nervous
system - so you’re still drunk, you just

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.230
don’t feel drunk.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:06.780
Researchers say their discovery could be useful
for treating loss of consciousness and impaired

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:10.760
mobility among people with acute alcohol poisoning.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:16.889
But no word yet on when you’ll be able to
order one bourbon, one scotch and one FGF21.

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:20.199
The T-1000 Terminator begins with THIS SNAIL.

00:04:20.199 --> 00:04:24.300
Engineers at Carnegie Mellon University in
Pittsburgh have created a breakthrough in

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:31.400
softbiotics - a flexible, self-healing, liquid-metal
filled organogel with metal-like conductivity,

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.990
that can support electrical motors and digital
electronics.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:38.680
So far they’ve used this incredible advance
to create…this snail.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:43.509
It may move slowly, but when researchers cut
the circuits that powered its locomotion,

00:04:43.509 --> 00:04:50.270
the organogel healed itself and restored almost
70% of the lost power, making it the first

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:55.490
of a new generation of robots with integrated,
regenerating, sensing, movements - and probably

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:59.360
a desire to terminate snail John Connor.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.620
Ancient Romans REALLY wanted this dead guy
to STAY DEAD.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:07.949
The tomb of an Imperial Roman noble family
was recently excavated by archaeologists at

00:05:07.949 --> 00:05:13.830
Catholic University Leuven and it contained
a body sealed with an unheard-of three separate

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.240
protections to stop them from coming back
from the dead.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:22.550
First, the body was burned inside the tomb
and left there, which is extremely rare in

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.550
Roman burials.

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:28.610
Second, it was “nailed down” with dead
nails that had been intentionally bent and

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:32.449
disfigured, a known ancient charm against
evil magic.

00:05:32.449 --> 00:05:37.580
Finally, they sealed him under a layer of
quicklime covered in heavy tiles, to stop

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.569
the body from rising again.

00:05:39.569 --> 00:05:45.880
No Roman burial has ever been found with all
three of these ancient protections in one

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:46.880
place.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:52.890
So let me know what YOU think this guy did
to earn unprecedented levels of zombie-proofing.

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:57.430
And now for a news report on the Nintendo
