00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:05.910
Because they say they’re bad for kids.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:06.910
She doesn’t like it.

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:09.240
This girl’s mother doesn’t like the game.

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:13.440
Cause she thinks that you’re going brain
dead while you’re watching it.

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:17.590
Maybe you will be brain dead from staring
at this thing all the time?

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.600
No!

